@1 = ~Mantidrake Spike~
@2 = ~Mantidrake Spike
(Alteration)

Level: 2
Range: Personal
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

The Black Dragon Disciple can throw spikes from his body as a natural throwing ranged attack. He can create a spike for each of his levels. When thrown and hitting, they deal 1d4 points of piercing damage and the target must save vs. Death at -2 or suffer 2d4 points of poison damage.

The caster gains a +5 bonus to hit with the missiles, and each spike is considered to be of +2 enchantment to determine what it can hit. The wizard may discharge up to 3 missiles per round.~

// Spikes (item)
@3 = ~Mantidrake Spikes~
@4 = ~Mantidrake Spikes

Spikes grown from the caster's body, ready to be thrown.

STATISTICS:

Damage: 1d4 (piercing)
Poison: save vs. Death at -2 or 2d4 poison damage
THAC0: +5 bonus
Attacks per round: 3
Counts as a +2 weapon for the purpose of hitting creatures~
